 found)", "variant": "return"}, {"id": "m7", "from": "bundle", "to": "op", "y": 432, "label": "400 if not AT_HUB or has active mission", "variant": "dashed", "note": "All orders must share same origin + dest hub"}, {"id": "m8", "from": "bundle", "to": "db", "y": 484, "label": "SELECT Drone WHERE id = :droneId (if provided)", "variant": "default"}, {"id": "m9", "from": "db", "to": "bundle", "y": 512, "label": "drone (payload_capacity_kg)", "variant": "return"}, {"id": "m10", "from": "bundle", "to": "op", "y": 548, "label": "200 { is_valid, total_payload, remaining_capacity }", "variant": "emphasis", "note": "is_valid=False if payload > drone capacity"}], "activations": [{"participant": "router", "from": 155, "to": 560, "type": "backend"}, {"participant": "bundle", "from": 227, "to": 554, "type": "backend"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 263, "to": 342, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 367, "to": 406, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 479, "to": 518, "type": "database"}], "cards": [{"dot": "emerald", "title": "Validation Rules", "items": ["All orders must share same origin_hub_id + destination_hub_id", "All orders must be AT_HUB status", "If strict_payment: all must be PAID", "No order with active mission (SCHEDULED/IN_PROGRESS/FLYING)", "If drone_id provided: total_payload ≤ drone.payload_capacity"]}, {"dot": "cyan", "title": "Drone Capacity Guidelines", "items": ["Swift: max 1.0 kg (Light)", "Falcon: max 5.0 kg (Medium — 2-4 orders)", "Eagle: max 10.0 kg (Heavy — multiple heavy orders)"]}, {"dot": "rose", "title": "Error Cases", "items": ["404: Order not found", "400: Order not AT_HUB or has active mission", "400: Mismatched origin/dest hub between orders", "400: Total payload exceeds drone capacity", "is_valid=False returned with descriptive message"]}]}